{"availability":"available","full":"iliyasalve/aco-routing-exploration","name":"aco-routing-exploration","description":"An interactive Ant Colony Optimization (ACO) visualization built with JS. Explores ACO's potential for network routing (e.g., Lightning Network) and includes a conceptual Python model.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-10-10T21:37:57Z","updated":"2026-07-12T23:51:26Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://aco-algorithm.labig.dev","topics":["aco","ant-colony-optimization","blockchain","demo","graph-algorithms","javascript","lightning-network","optimization","pathfinding","python","routing","simulation","tsp","visualization"],"demo":"https://iliyasalve.github.io/aco-routing-exploration/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T17:26:43.326Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T17:26:43.326Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T17:26:43.326Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:45.304Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:32:42.157Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:26:43.326Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This project explores the application of Ant Colony Optimization (ACO) for payment routing in decentralized networks. The work is heavily inspired by the \"Ant Routing\" model proposed in the scientific paper \"Ant Routing scalability for the Lightning Network\" by Cyril Grunspan, Gabriel Lehéricy, and Ricardo Pérez-Marco.","During the study of the Lightning Network, this approach drew significant attention due to its decentralized and adaptive nature, which aligns perfectly with the core principles of blockchain technologies. This repository contains a web-based visualization and a conceptual Python implementation to explore and demonstrate this concept."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/iliyasalve/aco-routing-exploration/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7efddab0abd546